{"server":"cn","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_06_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_06","title":"10:26P.M.","storyCode":"CB-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"fad308207a92d8fe5f263a31c0496251c1fd1c8ce83ec329c8807e77de7a2027","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"面对全力以赴的企鹅物流，甘比诺家族迅速败下阵来，但酒吧也已经被破坏殆尽，恼怒的大帝终于下定决心，正面决战拉开帷幕。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，叙拉古的丧家犬，弩弹打完了？可我怎么还活着呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"真不愧是大帝，枪林弹雨里还端着酒杯，运气不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......龙门从来不会纵容真正的厮杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不按游戏规则来，可是会被驱逐出局的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"规则？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"当龙门警察到场的时候，只会看到你们几个支离破碎的尸首，企鹅物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......街道上都是他们的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"连后门都堵上了，唉，看来这位先生一直怀恨在心嘛，做得很彻底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭那个懦夫太过忌惮鼠王和魏彦吾了，后者兴许值得关注......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你和那只装腔作势的老鼠，除了让人作呕的本事一流之外，一文不值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你是真这么觉得？还是单纯想放狠话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"诚心实意，“大帝先生”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"可颂，帮我捡瓶酒，我来帮他修理一下大脑皮层。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"但是老板，不瞒你说，我们已经砸掉了上百万龙门币的红酒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......那他们的命值多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么看也没这个数吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"要动真格的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢。我们一定会恪守和小魏的约定，在龙门之内，不打真架，不闹人命，一切生意上的纠纷，在商言商。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"只是今天我们总计逃亡了五个小时，超出了我日常工作时间的两倍，两倍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅如此，我们还炸掉了整整一年分的行动补贴！汽车，红酒，还有我的珍藏黑胶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，在我的酒吧发生了一些预料之内的意外死亡，这总没什么问题吧？嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，你的名字就让我感到不快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"我不记得自己认识你这样的叙拉古人。但你会再次夹着尾巴逃离龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你会后悔诋毁我的家族，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"到底谁才是逃来龙门的丧家之犬，你心里清楚。你根本不配与西西里人为敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"这才是像样的表情，德克萨斯！这才有点叙拉古人的样子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"真是意料之外呢，你也是被叫过来的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。不过能从商务酒会脱身的感觉也不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这些黑手党的小打小闹，值得这么兴师动众的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"不值得。而且我只是想从麻烦的社交里脱身，找个机会喘口气罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"可颂为她的锤子定制了新的配件。能天使让我帮忙保养她的守护铳。总之，还有很多事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，也许我也得麻烦你一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。除了本职工作，为同事们处理这些杂务，也是我的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"这把法杖，能帮我保管一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"白色的这把。你明白这其中的含义吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"至少今晚，就让我轻松一点吧，只是一场狂欢而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我总不能真的带着它跳进舞会现场，那会失控的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。交给我吧，这也是工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，说来说去，不还是工作嘛，你也真是辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"结束之后要不要去喝一杯？我请客好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"十分赞同。同事之间的酒会比无趣的应酬要好得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"但很可惜，看这动静，也许大地的尽头很难保全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么，你是刚回来龙门？对今晚的事情知道多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"全部。这次狂欢的来龙去脉并不复杂，一切情报昭然若揭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你不打算去帮个忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒绝。体力劳动就交给年轻气盛的孩子们吧，我就保管着你们几个人的货物，喝一杯茶，等着事情结束好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"好了。既然鼠王已经在等着你，那就玩得开心一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"——你也是，伊斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"难得的安魂夜，就不要这么辛苦地工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我先走一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"......安魂夜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，安魂夜应该放假来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"我为什么习惯性地加班了......嗯，亏大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少，她把你留给我了，我们可以难得叙叙旧了，老朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，把你握在手上的感觉还不赖，抱怨也没用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你无路可退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊，哈啊，德克萨斯，你的身手倒是对得起你的名字......所以你的家族——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"住口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯小姐~我比你多解决一个人哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"但压制头目的人是德克萨斯，至少要算三个人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？所以算我输吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没人和你比这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这里还有一瓶完整的，我看看价码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"一，二，三......七、七个零？谢天谢地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要怕！这些家伙不过就五个人而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不许说这种烂俗的台词！哦哒——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又、又砸头......呃...."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"而且算上我，是六个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"六名物流公司员工和一整支武装黑手党正面冲突，赢家竟然是前者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——这也太奇怪了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么奇怪的喔？论打群架的本事，人数差不太多的话我们就是龙门第一！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你们输了，投降吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"输？投降？哈，你真的是那个“德克萨斯”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦拔剑相向，西西里人之间就不存在“输赢”，只有“生死”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该后悔没有痛下杀手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"引爆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——！注意掩护！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——又是炸弹——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，又让他们逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"要追吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我也稍微有点，低估敌人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算只是逃来龙门的失败者，毕竟也是以西西里人自居的黑手党。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，你受伤了！？我、我来给你包扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"伤口不深，别紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不行！先坐下！我去找一下医疗箱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里人......西西里人是什么意思？是叙拉古人的某种称呼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古十二家族起源之一的西西里联合，是最开始通过暴力取得战果的城邦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是叙拉古语中“西西里人”的词源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在......这个词有了别的某种含义......已经很少有叙拉古人以“西西里”自居了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他们也许因为各种原因......不再强大，但既然他们如此自称......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，德克萨斯，一口气说这么多话很累吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"总之！他们真的是一群很危险的黑手党！虽然是自称的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"那就更不能让他们继续这样突然袭击了，损失只会不断扩大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得反击，我们需要一个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，都先等等，你们觉得我该找什么借口，向那位酒精过敏的白痴调酒师解释？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"这还有的解释吗......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"至少老板你坐着的高脚凳还是完好无缺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"就剩这张高脚凳了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，就剩这张高脚凳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，破碎的酒瓶和残垣断壁也有一种别样的美感，没错，这正是本人独特的风格化改造！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，这再怎么扯也太牵强了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"还是准备好全款赔偿吧，唔啊，企鹅物流的经济寒冬要到来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"而且酒味好重，身上也粘粘的，不过正好可以给伤口消毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"别胡闹了，哪有用葡萄酒消毒的！这里有医用酒精......为什么有个吸管？不、不管了，德克萨斯，我来帮你消毒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......我改主意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"既然他们执意要在安魂节这一天找麻烦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只好让他们此世安息了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克萨斯","能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可颂"]},{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["莫斯提马"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
